    <narrative xml:lang="EN">In partnership with Plan, Taakulo has since 2019 worked with vulnerable Somali communities affected by conflict and climate shocks to meet their acute needs and strengthen their resilience before the next crisis hits. Building on this partnership, Plan supports Taakulo&#x2019;s work across the triple nexus reducing immediate hardships and vulnerabilities through emergency water trucking and cash transfers. They also strengthen community resilience by ensuring sustainable, safe, accessible water sources for human consumption, livestock, and agriculture during droughts.</narrative>
   </description>
